{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"dropReports","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7ConsentV11dropReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA0B10DropReportOGvp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","text":"ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"property","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Consent.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Consent.swift#L117"}},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","text":"ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":"> { "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"get"},{"kind":"text","text":" }"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read. A record dropped for room is reported as it is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped; while that report waits unread, later ones merge into it, one report counting"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them all across their timestamps. So the reports waiting unread hold at most one overflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"report between any two others (denials and finished trackers), however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"overflow. The sequence ends once the consent is gone and every report has been read."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent/dropReports":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent\/dropReports","abstract":[{"text":"A report of each drop of held or recovered records, in the order they happen.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"dropReports","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consent\/dropreports","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"dropReports"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AsyncQueue"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers17ConsentDropReportO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ConsentDropReport"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","title":"AsyncQueue","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}],"kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/ConsentDropReport":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Records a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Consent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" dropped before they were delivered, and why."}],"title":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ConsentDropReport","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/consentdropreport","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/ConsentDropReport"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"abstract":[{"text":"The tracker app code tracks events with, and what it applies to each event before it is delivered: enrichers, samplers and consent.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/trackers","title":"Trackers","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","type":"topic"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Consent":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/T